      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "ASTON CLEESE (5) was midfield throughout and finished there last time when 4th (22.60) at this track. Form here at the trip sound including six wins. The form out of his last race has been franked. Rates on top in this line up. POWER AFFECT (1) goes very well here starting 12 times for four wins and two minors. Was out of placings last time (26.44) at this track in a Bottom Up - Grade 5, finishing seventh and beaten 7 lengths. Looks one of the chances. GAPING MARGIN (4) was well fancied in betting last start but could only manage half a length away in second (22.63). Has a strong record out of this box with three wins and a minor placing from six starts. Overdue and is among the main hopes. LARA MOON (2) is likely to have admirers.",
